fixture mend_ended_by_a_jump_keeps_the_stick
doc docs/adr/0013, Mend (task 6 review, H6): let go of Mend with the stick right, the run starts on that frame; a jump out of a channel with the stick right carries Ash right from its first frame.
room test/flat
option flame 66
option hearts 3
frames 40
input
  0..9 mend
  10..19 R
  20..29 mend
  30 R mend jump
  31..39 R
end
expect
  at 9 spell=mend
  at 10 spell=none vx>0
  at 29 spell=mend
  at 30 event.jump=1 vx>0
end
